PROJECT: AAVE

Official Name: Aave
Symbol: AAVE
Category: Decentralized non-custodial liquidity protocol / decentralized lending
Founding Entity: Aave is associated with PUSH LABS LIMITED (United Kingdom, incorporated Oct 19, 2018); juga terdaftar di Cayman Islands (190 Elgin Avenue, Grand Cayman, KY1-9008) dan berbasis di Switzerland serta London, UK
Founders: Stani Kulechov (Founder & CEO)
Core Team: Stani Kulechov (Founder & CEO), Linda Jeng (Chief Legal & Policy Officer), Nicole Butler (Chief Compliance Officer), Peter Kerr (Chief Financial Officer), Emilio Frangella (VP of Engineering / Head of Smart Contracts), Claudia Ceniceros (Chief of Comms & PR), Rowan van Ginkel (Chief Design Officer)
Country: Cayman Islands / Switzerland / United Kingdom (multinational)
Launch Date - Testnet: October 2019 (Aave V1 testnet); Aave V4 testnet: November 19, 2025
Launch Date - Mainnet: January 8, 2020 (Aave V1 di Ethereum)
Launch Date - TGE: October 2020 (token AAVE dirilis, migrasi LEND→AAVE 100:1)
Main Products: Aave V3 lending protocol; Aave V4 (mainnet Maret 2026); GHO stablecoin; flash loans; Aave Arc (institutional)
Official Website: https://aave.com/[reference:26]
Repository: https://github.com/aave[reference:27]; https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin[reference:28]
Documentation: https://aave.com/docs[reference:29]; https://aave.com/build[reference:30]
Social - X/Twitter: @aave; @aaveaave
Social - Discord: https://discord.com/invite/aave[reference:33] atau https://discord.gg/CvKUrqM[reference:34]
Social - Telegram: https://t.me/Aavesome[reference:35]
Block Explorer: Etherscan: https://etherscan.io/token/0x7fc66500c84a76ad7e9c93437bfc5ac33e2ddae9[reference:37]
Token Contract: 0x7fc66500c84a76ad7e9c93437bfc5ac33e2ddae9 (Ethereum, ERC-20)
Chain(s): Ethereum, Polygon, Avalanche, BNB Chain, Fantom, Harmony, Base, Arbitrum, Optimism, Gnosis, Scroll, Metis, ZKsync Era
Ecosystem: DeFi lending & borrowing; GHO stablecoin; Aave DAO governance; Aave Labs; Aave Chan Initiative (ACI)

Open Threads

· Founding entity / yurisdiksi legal pasti: sumber menyebut Switzerland, Cayman Islands, dan London UK; Aave DAO juga mengusulkan entitas hukum Cayman Foundation (A-C Prime Foundation).
· Ukuran core team tidak diungkap secara publik; daftar nama diekstrapolasi dari berbagai sumber.
· Tanggal testnet awal (V1) tidak terdokumentasi secara resmi; sumber menyebut "October 2019".
